1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,480
 A principle that has become very meaningful in our family.

2
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:13,080
 We keep the commandments because we love God, not merely because we hope to receive the blessings

3
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,600
 that come from obedience.

4
00:00:15,600 --> 00:00:21,440
 Commandments are given to draw us closer to the Savior, to protect us and to help us

5
00:00:21,440 --> 00:00:27,360
 remain free from sin and many of the challenges the world presents.

6
00:00:27,360 --> 00:00:32,120
 This does no mean that we will be free from trials or difficulties.

7
00:00:32,120 --> 00:00:38,240
 All of us will face moments of uncertainty, financial hardship, illness or loss.

8
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:43,200
 Yet even when we don't understand the purpose of our trials, we can have the assurance that

9
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:49,680
 the Lord knows our circumstances, honors our obedience, and fulfills his promises in his

10
00:00:49,680 --> 00:00:52,040
 own time and way.

11
00:00:52,040 --> 00:00:55,840
 the end of the day.

